Package: speechmatics
Title: R Client for the Speechmatics API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nic", "Crane", , "thisisnic@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Transcribe audio files using the Speechmatics speech-to-text
    API. Supports custom vocabulary, speaker diarization, punctuation
    control, and audio filtering.
URL: https://github.com/thisisnic/speechmatics
BugReports: https://github.com/thisisnic/speechmatics/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports:
    cli,
    curl,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    rlang
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
